meta {
  name: Expire Reservations
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/maintenance/expire-reservations
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Marks any PENDING reservation whose expires_at has passed as EXPIRED and releases its quantity. The default reservation TTL is 10 minutes, so you won't see an effect immediately after creating a fresh reservation unless you lower RESERVATION_TTL_MINUTES in .env first (e.g. to 1) and wait, or manually update expires_at in the database for a quick demo.
}
